🎨 User Interface Design
🔹 Design Philosophy
🎨 Color Scheme
Blue (#1E88E5) – Primary actions and headers
White (#FFFFFF) – Background
Gray (#F5F5F5) – Secondary sections
Green (#43A047) – Success indicators
Red (#E53935) – Errors and warnings
🔤 Typography
Font: Roboto
Font Sizes:
Headings: 20–24px
Body Text: 14–16px
Small Text: 12px
📱 Responsiveness
Mobile screens: ≥ 375px
Desktop screens: ≥ 1200px
Full HD support: 1920px
(Tailwind CSS ensures flexible layouts)
🖥 Application Screens
🔹 Login Screen
Inputs:
Email
Password
Constraints:
Valid email format
Password ≥ 8 characters with uppercase, lowercase, digit, and special character
🔹 Dashboard
Features:
Upcoming classes
Assignments
Notifications
Controls:
Filters
Search bar
Action buttons
🔹 Classroom Page
Features:
Class details
Assignment list
Student list
Constraints:
Assignment title ≤ 50 characters
File upload: PDF/DOCX only
🔹 Assignment Submission
Constraints:
File size ≤ 10MB
Optional notes ≤ 200 characters
🔹 Attendance Page
Features:
Mark Present / Absent / Tardy
Save attendance
Constraint:
No future dates allowed
🔹 Notification Page
Actions:
Mark as read
Delete notification
✅ Conclusion
The e-Classroom Management System is a scalable, secure, and user-friendly platform designed to enhance online education experiences through structured architecture, efficient data handling, and modern UI practices.
